{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.ParticleInteractions.mass_categorical_descent","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.mass_categorical_descent","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.Algebra.BigOperators.Group.Finset.Basic"],"declarations":32,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels.descent_decomposition_operators","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels.descent_decomposition_operators","kind":"theorem","line":217,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L217-L227","doc":"**The descent decomposition for operator channels**: with\ncentrality derived from centre membership, the additive identity\n`B = B^desc + B^trans` holds — inherited from the tranche-1\ntheorem through the bridge.  Sorry-free end to end: the only\nremaining open item is the corpus *instance*\n(`A = H_n(q)`, `op λ = z_λ`, `contrib λ = m_e·y_λ χ^λ Δ_λ`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels.toChannels","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels.toChannels","kind":"def","line":206,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L206-L215","doc":"**Bridge to tranche 1**: an operator-channel structure induces the\npredicate-based channel structure, with `isCentral` specialised to\ncentre membership (decidability supplied classically — in the\nfinite Wedderburn case it is a finite check). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels.isCentral_pair_comm","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels.isCentral_pair_comm","kind":"theorem","line":198,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L198-L204","doc":"A central channel's operator commutes with **every** channel\noperator — central or not (only `c`'s centrality is needed).  In\nparticular the descended sector is commutative, and it also\ncommutes with the transient sector. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels.isCentral_commutes","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels.isCentral_commutes","kind":"theorem","line":192,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L192-L196","doc":"**The Casimir property is a theorem**: a central channel's operator\ncommutes with every element of the algebra. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels.IsCentral","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels.IsCentral","kind":"def","line":185,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L185-L190","doc":"Centrality, **derived from the algebra**: the channel's operator\nlies in the centre `Z(A)`.  In the corpus instantiation\n`A = H_n(q)` this is exactly \"the Casimir lies in `Z(H_n(q))`\" —\nthe defining property of the descended component, now a statement\nabout `A` rather than a field of the class. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels.contrib","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels.contrib","kind":"def","line":177,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L177-L177","doc":"Per-channel binding contribution. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels.op","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels.op","kind":"def","line":175,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L175-L175","doc":"The channel's operator (corpus: block Casimir / divisor-local). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels.chFin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels.chFin","kind":"def","line":173,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L173-L173","doc":"Finitely many channels. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels.Channel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels.Channel","kind":"def","line":171,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L171-L171","doc":"The channel index (corpus: partitions + divisor sites). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels.mk","kind":"ctor","line":169,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L169-L169","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentOperatorChannels","kind":"class","line":162,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L162-L177","doc":"**Tranche 2 of the route-(b) formalization** (bean `qou-x3gr`):\ncentrality becomes *semantic*.  Each channel now carries an\n**operator** in a ring `A` (corpus: the block Casimir in `H_n(q)`\nfor the Wedderburn channels; the divisor-local operator for the\ntransient ones), and centrality is **derived** as membership in the\ncentre of `A` — no predicate field.  The tranche-1 structure is\nrecovered as the shadow `toChannels` below. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.mass_categorical_descent_unconstrained_false","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.mass_categorical_descent_unconstrained_false","kind":"theorem","line":144,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L144-L156","doc":"**The flat data-field form is refutable as written** — the data-only\nclass below never relates the fields its conclusion names, so\n`∀ instances` admits ones that simply disagree. Not an open gap: no\nunconditional `sorry` could ever be discharged. The fix is the\nchannel structure above (bean qou-octr → route (b), bean qou-e2fi):\nthe additive identity is derived from the decomposition, and the\nopen physics is confined to the (absent) corpus instance. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.mass_categorical_descent","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.mass_categorical_descent","kind":"theorem","line":120,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L120-L142","doc":"**Mass formula as descent decomposition**\n([`conj:mass-categorical-descent`]) — conditional on the channel\nstructure, now **sorry-free**: given the Wedderburn channel\ndecomposition (`MassDescentChannels`), the total binding splits as\n\n  `B(Z,N) = B^{desc}(Z,N) + B^{trans}(Z,N)`\n\nwith the descended component the sum over centre (`Z(H_n(q))`)\nchannels and the transient component the sum over the rest.\n\n**What is derived vs what is open.**  Derived: the additive identity,\nfor every channel structure (`descent_decomposition`).  Open (the\nphysics, named): instantiating `Channel`/`contrib`/`isCentral` with\nthe corpus objects — partitions `λ ⊢ n` with `contrib λ = m_e·y_λ\nχ^λ Δ_λ` and centrality = Casimir membership — and showing the\nresulting `B_total` is the physical binding.  That instantiation is\nthe manuscript-level descent statement; it lives in the *instance*,\nwhich this file honestly does not provide. ","formalizes":[{"@id":"block:conj:mass-categorical-descent","label":"conj:mass-categorical-descent","md":"quantum-observable-universe/mass-theory/mass-categorical-descent.md"}],"signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels.descent_decomposition","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels.descent_decomposition","kind":"theorem","line":107,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L107-L116","doc":"**The descent decomposition, derived**: `B = B^desc + B^trans` is the\nsplitting of a finite sum along a decidable predicate — the additive\nidentity holds for *every* channel structure, because `B_desc` and\n`B_trans` are *defined* as the two halves of the same decomposition\nthat defines `B_total`.  This is the honest content of the additive\nclaim: it is a property of the channel decomposition, not an extra\nphysical assumption. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels.B_trans","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels.B_trans","kind":"def","line":103,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L103-L105","doc":"Transient binding: the sum over the non-central channels. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels.B_desc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels.B_desc","kind":"def","line":99,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L99-L101","doc":"Descended (central) binding: the sum over the centre channels. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels.B_total","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels.B_total","kind":"def","line":96,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L96-L97","doc":"Total binding: the sum of every channel's contribution. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels.centralDec","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels.centralDec","kind":"def","line":88,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L88-L88","doc":"Centrality is decidable (Wedderburn: membership of the block's\nCasimir in the centre is a finite check). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels.isCentral","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels.isCentral","kind":"def","line":85,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L85-L85","doc":"Central (Casimir / `Z(H_n(q))`) channels. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels.contrib","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels.contrib","kind":"def","line":83,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L83-L83","doc":"Per-channel binding contribution. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels.chFin","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels.chFin","kind":"def","line":81,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L81-L81","doc":"Finitely many channels (Wedderburn: partitions of `n`). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels.Channel","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels.Channel","kind":"def","line":79,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L79-L79","doc":"The channel index (corpus: partitions + divisor sites). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels.mk","kind":"ctor","line":77,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L77-L77","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassDescentChannels","kind":"class","line":66,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L66-L88","doc":"**The channel structure of the descent decomposition** (route (b) of\nbean `qou-oq5r`, owner-selected 2026-08-14; bean `qou-e2fi`): the\nWedderburn picture, as genuine structure.  A finite type of\n**channels** (in the corpus: partitions `λ ⊢ n` indexing the\nWedderburn blocks of `H_n(q)`, plus the exceptional-divisor local\ncontributions), a per-channel binding **contribution** (in the\ncorpus: `m_e · y_λ χ^λ Δ_λ` for the central channels), and a\ndecidable predicate marking the **central** (Casimir / centre\n`Z(H_n(q))`) channels.  None of the fields is the conclusion: the\nadditive identity is *derived* from finiteness of the channel\ndecomposition (`descent_decomposition` below). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassCategoricalDescentContext.B_BW","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassCategoricalDescentContext.B_BW","kind":"def","line":64,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L64-L64","doc":"The Bethe–Weizsäcker liquid-drop value, recovered as one\nphenomenology of the descent decomposition. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassCategoricalDescentContext.B_trans","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassCategoricalDescentContext.B_trans","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L61-L61","doc":"The **transient** component — localised to the exceptional divisors\n`E_i` of the brane blow-up. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassCategoricalDescentContext.B_desc","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassCategoricalDescentContext.B_desc","kind":"def","line":58,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L58-L58","doc":"The **descended** (central) component — Casimir operators in the\ncentre `Z(H_n(q))`, indexed by partitions `λ ⊢ n`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassCategoricalDescentContext.B","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassCategoricalDescentContext.B","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L55-L55","doc":"The total nuclear binding energy `B(Z,N)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassCategoricalDescentContext.m_endo","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassCategoricalDescentContext.m_endo","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L53-L53","doc":"The mass endomorphism `𝔪 : A → A` (abstract carrier). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassCategoricalDescentContext.CategoricalObj","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassCategoricalDescentContext.CategoricalObj","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L51-L51","doc":"The categorical object `A` of the QOU `(C, A, τ)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassCategoricalDescentContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassCategoricalDescentContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L49-L49","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassCategoricalDescentContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.MassCategoricalDescentContext","kind":"class","line":45,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/mass_categorical_descent.lean#L45-L64","doc":"Data of the mass-categorical-descent claim.  All fields are genuine\ninputs: the categorical object, the mass endomorphism, and the total\nbinding `B` together with its two descent components.  None is the\nconclusion. ","signatureChunk":0}]}